      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s name honors two Kirby Lumber Company figures: manager Bonner and surgeon Robert Withrow Wier.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22,
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bon_Wier%2C_Texas",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A post office began serving Bon Wier in 1906, marking the community’s first official federal presence.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
