        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bon_Wier%2C_Texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Sawmills powered Bon Wier’s economy well into the 1990s, long after the logging camps faded in the 1930s.",
